1315 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(Five vague requirements turned into precise, testable ones: "make it fast" becomes the Daily Sales Flash sent by 07:30 IST on working days, p95 over the month; "make it reliable" becomes at most 2 pipeline runs a year needing a person to step in, counted monthly from Dagster's run history; "make it secure" becomes no analyst's login reading another branch's customer data, reviewed quarterly; "make it scale" becomes the 06:30 run finishing by 07:15 and the dashboard's first view loading in under 3 seconds, p95, at 5 times today's order volume; "keep it cheap" becomes platform cost under 0.50 rupees per 1,000 order lines, reviewed monthly)/P 657 0 R/Pg 134 0 R/K 2>>
endobj

