5724 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A value-against-effort chart on 1-to-5 scales with risk shown as bubble size and as a number in each bubble. Daily Sales Flash \(value 4, effort 1, risk 1\) and the branch macro \(value 3, effort 1, risk 1\) sit at the left as quick wins. PO intake in assisted mode \(value 4, effort 3, risk 3\) and the CRM reverse-ETL syncs \(value 3, effort 3, risk 3\) sit in the middle. PO intake straight through sits at the top middle \(value 5, effort 3\) as the largest bubble, risk 5, with a dashed outline. The Dagster pipeline \(value 5, effort 5, risk 3\) sits at the top right as a big bet.)/P 657 0 R/Pg 333 0 R/K 9>>
endobj

