5978 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(Six numbered layers in two rows of three, joined by arrows: sources, ingestion, warehouse, then semantic layer, delivery and activation, and monitoring. Each box says what does that job on Riverstone's platform, with chapter numbers, and what does it inside a macro: the branch files it opens, Workbooks.Open, the Master sheet it rebuilds, the one formula its author chose for revenue, the PDF it emails, and its checks since Chapter 19. A note underneath says a single macro does all six jobs inside one workbook, while Chapter 46's pipeline does each in its own named piece.)/P 657 0 R/Pg 343 0 R/K 10>>
endobj

