6068 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A hub-and-spoke diagram. In the middle, a box labelled Every automation lists the Daily Sales Flash, the Dagster pipeline, the CRM syncs, PO intake, the support assistant, the defect model, the branch macros, and all 24 in the inventory. Four boxes around it, each with an arrow running level into the middle box's edge: notification service \(one function sends email or chat for everyone\), credential vault \(no password in any script; rotate without editing code\), run logs \(every run's start, end, outcome and key numbers in one place\), and alerting \(a failure pages the owner the same way every time\). A note says Chapter 20 built the minimum version of each for one script: its own mail code, environment variables in a .env file instead of a vault, a log file, and a failure email.)/P 657 0 R/Pg 347 0 R/K 20>>
endobj

