6130 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A table of what Riverstone's first automation audit found, 24 automations in five categories, each with a count, an action in words, and examples. Documented, owned, monitored: 6, keep, the model to copy \(the Flash, the Dagster pipeline, the CRM syncs, the support assistant, the defect model, PO intake\). Working but no owner on record: 11, urgent, name an owner. Duplicated logic, disagreeing outputs: 4, merge each pair \(Delhi and Kolkata consolidation macros; Bengaluru and Mumbai HO stock-report reformatters\). Business-critical single point of failure: 1, confirm the fix held \(MASTER_FINAL_v7 from Chapter 19, rewritten and owned since then\). Actively broken, nobody had noticed: 2, fix now. A total row says 24, and that 17 had no owner, no monitoring and no written failure plan.)/P 657 0 R/Pg 351 0 R/K 6>>
endobj

