<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/Alt(A timeline of six stops, each with its part and chapters above the line and what it added below. Parts 0 and 1, Chapters 1 to 9: what data is, and where it leads. Part 2, Chapters 10 to 27: from one query to one trusted automation. Parts 3 and 4, Chapters 28 to 44: engineering discipline and models. Parts 5 and 6, Chapters 45 to 59: pipelines and AI in production. Part 7, Chapters 60 to 66: a platform designed, governed, secured and costed. Chapter 67: led, and someone else's turn to learn from you.)/P 657 0 R/Pg 615 0 R/K 6>>
endobj

